<title>AUSTRIA: Creditanstalt sees rise in full-year net profit.</title>
<headline>Creditanstalt sees rise in full-year net profit.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austria's Creditanstalt said on Tuesday it expected an increase in full-year net profit from last year's 2.93 billion schillings after reporting a 31 percent rise in first quarter operating profit.</p>
<p>&quot;The very good operating profit of the first months of the current year makes us expect a further gain in full-year net profit compared to 1996,&quot; the bank said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom, +431 53112 274</p>
